## 4. Summary

The fix is a complete allocator pipeline rather than a single patch:

`coalesce → whole-CFG liveness → co-liveness interference (+ pre-colored phys regs, clobbers, calls) → frequency/rematerialization-weighted spill costs → Chaitin/Briggs coloring with spill-victim retry → spill-everywhere-at-def/use rewriting with dominance-aware rematerialization → independent verifier`

All 10 tests pass, including execution equivalence between the virtual-register program and the allocated/spilled physical-register program. The full markdown is saved at `/workspace/SOLUTION.md`.
